<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94685" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκεπ-άζω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ex.</u>
					40.3
				</span></i>
			: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέπω</span>) prose form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκεπάω</span>:— <i>cover,
			shelter</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὰ δεόμενα σκέπης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					3.10.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eq.</u>
				12.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>IA</u>
				711b32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PA</u>
				658b6
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς</span></b> . [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ] ἱματίοις</span>
			<i>cover</i> him with blankets, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1088.47
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>:—
				Med.
			, aor. 1, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				4.549
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁκόσα ὑπὸ τοῦ ἱματίου ἐσκέπασται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.8.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				785a27
			</span></i>; esp. of armour, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.22.10
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοραῖς τὸ σῶμα ς.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					1241 iv 18
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσκεπασμένην
				σκοπαῖς</span>
			<i>guarded, watched</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				1311
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἀπὸ καύματ ος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Si.</u>
					14.27
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>protect</i> or <i>shelter</i>, esp. by patronage, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς πλινθουλκούς, οὒς ἔδει
					λειτουργεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					4.440.14
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHib.</u>
				1.35.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				110.15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>exercise unauthorized patronage over</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἱερὰς ἀρούρας</span> Wilcken <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				65.60
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc. rei, <i>keep off</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καῦμα τῶν Ἐρώτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Anacreont.</u>
					17.9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
